    "raw_text": "\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the text prompt.\n\nThe text prompt asks for: \"生成一段15秒、9:16竖屏的二维手绘动画团队人物短片，采用二维手绘动画风格\" (Generate a 15-second, 9:16 vertical format two-dimensional hand-drawn animation short about a team of people in a two-dimensional hand-drawn style).\n\nLooking at the frames:\n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\n- The visuals are generally clean with solid rendering quality. The resolution is adequate and the lighting remains consistent across scenes.\n- The animation maintains a cohesive two-dimensional hand-drawn aesthetic, with smooth motion and stable character proportions throughout.\n- There are no major distortions or artifacts; overall clarity is good, though not flawless, which aligns with a high-but-not-perfect Visual Quality score.\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\n- The video largely satisfies the prompt requirements: it is clearly a two-dimensional hand-drawn animation featuring a team of four individuals in business attire within an office setting, presented in a vertical orientation suitable for mobile viewing.\n- The duration appears to be around 15 seconds, and the scene composition consistently reflects the requested elements (four people, office environment, professional attire).\n- The alignment is strong overall, with only minor deviations that do not meaningfully detract from the intended prompt fulfillment.\n\nPhysical/Common-sense Consistency Analysis:\n- The scene adheres to plausible physical behavior: characters move naturally, shadows align with window light, and spatial relationships remain coherent.\n- The office environment shows realistic architectural details and consistent perspective, contributing to believable interactions and movement.\n- While there may be occasional small timing or spacing nuances, these do not undermine the overall realism or common-sense consistency.\n\nOverall assessment:\n- The video demonstrates solid technical execution and faithful adherence to the prompt, with minor imperfections that keep all three dimensions at a high level. This corresponds to a score of 4 for Visual Quality, Text-to-Video Alignment, and Physical/Common-sense Consistency.\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 4\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 4\n"
